.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"袴！袴！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"字が綺麗に書けたか、\n上手くいったかとかではなく、\nなにより大切なのは気持ち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46も2期生が入り\nまた新たにスタートします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は高校3年生になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢と希望をもって、頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/31/4118235/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"袴！袴！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}